inate with Pteridophyta (spore producing plants having vascular tissue and roots) and Bryophyta (spore producing plants lacking vascular tissue and roots)1. (noun) in former classifications: comprising plants with a vascular system including ferns and fern allies as well as seed plants1. (adjective) of or relating to a military division — "divisional artillery"
